    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "761c5de3-39b5-4d6d-895f-d9daafb674a2",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Hitman 8. Episode 2. Two worlds apart",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GOLDEN_GECKO",
        "PublicId": "127439074320",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3e3e3752-37db-4b0f-8ff3-827d4c565e55).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Today we have two targets in completely different situations in life. The first one is called Mariam Amir. She is in terrible debt and the debt deadline has already passed. The debtor has received a rumor that Mariam is planning to murder him, so the debtor asks us to take Mariam out. Then we find an old ICA agent, Sebastian Sato. For some reason, he has started giving away secret information about ICA to the media for free, so I want to silence him once and for all. Good luck.",
